==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsman (form 2)]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 2)]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
**2 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*The Japanese stage name is likely based off of the Japanese proverb "急がば回れ", meaning that a secure route is ultimately faster than a risky one, even if it seems to be a detour.

